<title>USA: PepsiCo names intl pres of restaurant unit.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo names intl pres of restaurant unit.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soft drink maker PepsiCo said on Tuesday that it named Peter Bassi president of its international restaurant division.</p>
<p>Pepsi said Bassi, a 25-year veteran of the company, replaces James O'Neal, who recently was named president of Frito-Lay International.</p>
<p>Most recently, Bassi served as executive vice president of the company's restaurants division in Asia.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
